# Udhar Card Merchant Mobile App: Product & Integration Requirements Document (PRD)

This document provides the full product requirements, UI/UX design specifications, and API integration instructions for developers building the **Udhar Card Merchant Mobile App** (compatible with iOS and Android).

---

## 1. Document Overview

### Objectives
*   **Empower Merchants:** Give merchants a fast, reliable mobile app to manage customer credits ("Udhar") and collections on the go.
*   **Frictionless Payments:** Integrate UPI QR Code generation directly into the workflow for instant offline-to-online reconciliation.
*   **Reliability:** Allow offline access to view ledgers and prepare transactions, with auto-sync when network connectivity returns.

### Target Platforms
*   **iOS:** Swift / SwiftUI or Flutter (supporting iOS 15+)
*   **Android:** Kotlin / Jetpack Compose or Flutter (supporting Android 8.0 / API Level 26+)

