## 2. System Architecture & Authentication

### 2.1 API Base Configuration
All requests must communicate with the main gateway:
*   **Base URL:** `https://pay.udharcard.shop/api`
*   **Global Headers:**
    ```http
    Content-Type: application/json
    Accept: application/json
    Authorization: Bearer <token>
    ```

### 2.2 Auth Flow Spec
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Mobile App Client
    participant API as Merchant Gateway API
    
    App->>API: POST /login (username, password, type="merchant")
    alt Credentials Valid
        API-->>App: 200 OK (token, status="success")
        Note over App: Save token securely in iOS Keychain / Android Keystore
    else Credentials Invalid
        API-->>App: 200/422 Error (status="error", errors)
        Note over App: Show user error toast
    end
```

