## 6. Security & Compliance

*   **Secure Storage:** Tokens and credentials must never be written to plaintext storage (SharedPreferences / UserDefaults). Use iOS Keychain Services and Android Keystore.
*   **Rooting/Jailbreak Detection:** Prevent app from opening on rooted or compromised devices to protect financial ledger data.
*   **SSL Pinning:** Bind network requests explicitly to `pay.udharcard.shop` SSL certificates to avoid man-in-the-middle exploits.
